OL,3,ATrump says he is banning CNN and
OL,4,APolitico from White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has announced
OL,7,Fthat he is "immediately" banning CNN,
OL,8,FMS NOW and Politico from the White
OL,9,FHouse, the latest twist in his fraught
OL,10,Frelationship with media outlets.
OL,12,FIn a post on Truth Social on Friday,
OL,13,FTrump said that the outlets "constantly
OL,14,Fwrite or report fiction or lies" about
OL,15,Fhis administration, although he
OL,16,Fprovided no examples.
OL,18,FTrump later called it a "very simple
OL,19,Fban", but did not explain how it would
OL,20,Fwork. It is unclear whether employees
OL,21,Fof those outlets would be prevented
OL,22,Ffrom entering the White House grounds.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
